  An open, evidence-forward draft accountability standard for public surveillance
  systems, with structured evidence and a Flock Safety ALPR case study. The
  documentation and structured factual content use CC BY 4.0; validation code
  uses the MIT License. This citation does not imply certification, accreditation,
  endorsement, or a finding of wrongdoing.
